{
  "id": "grammar-3",
  "world": "grammar",
  "order": 3,
  "type": "grammar",
  "title": "兩個以上：名詞加 s 或 es",
  "titleEn": "Plural Nouns",
  "summary": "學會把「一個」變成「很多個」。",
  "minutes": 12,
  "steps": [
    {
      "kind": "concept",
      "title": "中文概念",
      "body": [
        "中文說「一本書」、「兩本書」，「書」這個字不會變。",
        "英文不一樣：兩個以上的東西，名詞後面要加 s 或 es，這叫做「複數」。",
        "這一課只學最常用的兩條規則。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "explain",
      "title": "簡單說明",
      "body": [
        "看名詞的最後一個字母："
      ],
      "table": {
        "head": [
          "名詞結尾",
          "怎麼變",
          "例子"
        ],
        "rows": [
          [
            "大部分的名詞",
            "加 s",
            "book → books、key → keys"
          ],
          [
            "s、x、sh、ch 結尾",
            "加 es",
            "bus → buses、box → boxes、dish → dishes、watch → watches"
          ]
        ]
      },
      "tip": "一個的時候用 a／an，兩個以上就不用 a／an：a book → two books。"
    },
    {
      "kind": "examples",
      "title": "英文例句",
      "items": [
        {
          "en": "I have two books.",
          "zh": "我有兩本書。",
          "highlight": "books",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-3/ex1.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "She eats three apples.",
          "zh": "她吃三顆蘋果。",
          "highlight": "apples",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-3/ex2.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "He has two boxes.",
          "zh": "他有兩個箱子。",
          "highlight": "boxes",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-3/ex3.mp3"
        },
        {
          "en": "I see two buses.",
          "zh": "我看到兩台公車。",
          "highlight": "buses",
          "audio": "assets/audio/lessons/grammar-3/ex4.mp3"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "breakdown",
      "title": "句子拆解",
      "items": [
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "two",
              "label": "數量（兩個）"
            },
            {
              "text": "book",
              "label": "名詞"
            },
            {
              "text": "+ s",
              "label": "大部分加 s"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "two books ＝ 兩本書"
        },
        {
          "parts": [
            {
              "text": "two",
              "label": "數量（兩個）"
            },
            {
              "text": "box",
              "label": "x 結尾"
            },
            {
              "text": "+ es",
              "label": "加 es"
            }
          ],
          "zh": "two boxes ＝ 兩個箱子"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "contrast",
      "title": "正確與錯誤示範",
      "items": [
        {
          "wrong": "I have two book.",
          "right": "I have two books.",
          "why": "兩本以上，book 要加 s。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "He has two boxs.",
          "right": "He has two boxes.",
          "why": "box 是 x 結尾，要加 es。"
        },
        {
          "wrong": "I have a books.",
          "right": "I have a book.",
          "why": "a 是「一個」，後面不能接複數。"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "kind": "practice",
      "title": "互動練習",
      "intro": "選出正確的名詞形式。",
      "questions": [
        {
          "id": "g3-s-a",
          "group": "g3-s",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "sentence": "I have two ___.",
          "zh": "我有兩本書。",
          "options": [
            "book",
            "books",
            "bookes"
          ],
          "answer": "books",
          "explanation": "兩本書是複數，book 是大部分的名詞，加 s 變成 books。"
        },
        {
          "id": "g3-x-a",
          "group": "g3-x",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
