          "zh": "他有兩個箱子。",
          "options": [
            "boxs",
            "box",
            "boxes"
          ],
          "answer": "boxes",
          "explanation": "box 是 x 結尾，複數要加 es：boxes。"
        },
        {
          "id": "g3-ch-a",
          "group": "g3-ch",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "sentence": "I want three ___.",
          "zh": "我想要三支手錶。",
          "options": [
            "watches",
            "watchs",
            "watch"
          ],
          "answer": "watches",
          "explanation": "watch（手錶）是 ch 結尾，複數加 es：watches。"
        },
        {
          "id": "g3-one-a",
          "group": "g3-one",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "選出正確答案",
          "sentence": "I eat an ___.",
          "zh": "我吃一顆蘋果。",
          "options": [
            "apples",
            "apple"
          ],
          "answer": "apple",
          "explanation": "an 是「一個」，後面用單數 apple，不加 s。"
        },
        {
          "id": "g3-pick-a",
          "group": "g3-pick",
          "type": "choice",
          "prompt": "哪一句是正確的？",
          "zh": "我有兩個杯子。",
          "options": [
            "I have two cup.",
            "I have a cups.",
            "I have two cups."
          ],
          "answer": "I have two cups.",
          "explanation": "兩個杯子是複數，cup 加 s 變成 cups，而且前面不能有 a。"
        }
      ],
      "similar": [
        {
